&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HighRadius is always looking for the next generation of Account Executives to join our Enterprise Net-New sales team! In this role, you’ll be responsible for end-to-end sales cycles, engaging with finance leaders across North America (companies with &amp;gt;$1B revenue) to showcase how our AI-powered solutions can transform their financial operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for &lt;strong&gt;highly motivated, results-driven sales professionals&lt;/strong&gt; with a strong background in value-based selling motions, preferably in SaaS or IT Services &amp;amp; Consulting. To be successful in this role, you should have experience in prospecting, consultative selling, and closing complex deals with C-level executives. As a seller at HighRadius, you’ll have the opportunity to work with a dynamic, global team, and be part of a company recognized for innovation and rapid growth. If you thrive in a high-performance environment and want to make a measurable impact, we want to hear from you. In this role, you will be responsible for covering prospects and current clients across the US. As a seller at HighRadius, you can expect regular travel to meet with customers in your assigned territory (40%+)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; Houston, TX&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day-to-Day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a consultative trusted advisor to a portfolio of HighRadius prospects and customers, with a core focus on developing and closing new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with executive leaders and key client stakeholders to understand pain points and develop a roadmap and business cases for customers&#39; finance transformation using HighRadius solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve monthly sales targets and monthly recurring revenue quotas consistently. Manage and forecast sales activity and opportunities by flawlessly executing the HighRadius sales process and playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal HighRadius teams in coordinating communication and action plans to drive desired outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend in-person meetings on client site, as well as industry events, such as user groups, trade shows, and conferences to build and manage relationships with prospective and existing customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, or adjacent field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience in a value-based sales model, preferably in IT Services &amp;amp; Consulting or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate value to senior-level executives and proven experience in building and sustaining strong strategic relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written &amp;amp; verbal communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage strategic, consultative selling tactics and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to client sites &amp;amp; industry events up to 40% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-based commission (for eligible roles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits, 401k matching plan, and wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to earn stock options for top-performers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid company &amp;amp; flex holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ZINGy environment: quarterly events, team outings, and MORE!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Strategic Account Manager &lt;/strong&gt;(aka Digital Transformation Advisor) acts as a strategic partner to an existing portfolio of HighRadius clients, maximizing satisfaction while aggressively driving account expansion and new revenue opportunities. You will cultivate deep executive relationships to align our solutions with client pain points, creating transformation roadmaps that ensure high product adoption and consistent quota attainment. Through close cross-functional collaboration and a strong presence at client sites and industry events, you will secure long-term loyalty and continuous business growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office Requirement:&lt;/strong&gt; 5 days in our London Office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&lt;/strong&gt; RVP, Expansion Sales&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day-to-Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a consultative trusted advisor to a portfolio of existing HighRadius customers, with a core focus on developing and closing new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with executive leaders and key client stakeholders to drive high levels of satisfaction and product adoption&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct assessments to understand customer pain points and develop a roadmap and business cases for customers&#39; finance transformation using HighRadius solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve monthly sales targets and monthly recurring revenue quotas on a consistent basis. Manage and forecast sales activity and opportunities by flawlessly executing the HighRadius sales process and playbook&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal HighRadius teams in coordinating communication and action plans to drive desired outcomes for customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively ensure client issues and escalations are managed within a timely manner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend in-person meetings on client site, as well as industry events, such as user groups, trade shows, and conferences to build and manage relationships with prospective and existing customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to be Successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, Computer Science or adjacent field is preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in SaaS Account Management with knowledge of Record-to-Report (R2R) or Order-to-Cash (O2C) finance workflows highly preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;History of success in managing complex accounts and sales cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate value to senior-level executives and proven experience in building and sustaining strong strategic relationships. Excellent written &amp;amp; verbal communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of leveraging strategic, consultative selling tactics and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to local and regional client sites &amp;amp; industry events up to 40% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HighRadius is looking an &lt;strong&gt;Account Manager to join our mid-market expansion team&lt;/strong&gt;! In this role, you’ll be responsible for account management and end-to-end sales cycles, engaging with finance leaders across North America (companies with &amp;lt;$1B revenue) to showcase how our AI-powered solutions can transform their financial operations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;highly motivated, results-driven sales professional&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;with a strong background in value-based selling motions, preferably in SaaS or IT Services &amp;amp; Consulting. To be successful in this role, you should have experience in&amp;nbsp;prospecting, consultative selling, and closing complex deals with C-level executives. As a seller at HighRadius, you’ll have the opportunity to work with a dynamic, global team, and be part of a company recognized for innovation and rapid growth. If you thrive in a high-performance environment and want to make a measurable impact, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our sales team is based in Houston, covering current clients across the US. As a seller at HighRadius, you can expect regular travel to meet with customers in your assigned territory (40%+).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day-to-Day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a consultative, trusted advisor to a portfolio of HighRadius customers, with a core focus on developing and closing new business opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with executive leaders and key client stakeholders to understand pain points and develop a roadmap and business cases for customers&#39; finance transformation using HighRadius solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve monthly sales targets and monthly recurring revenue quotas consistently. Manage and forecast sales activity and opportunities by flawlessly executing the HighRadius sales process and playbook.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with internal HighRadius teams in coordinating communication and action plans to drive desired outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attend in-person meetings on client site, as well as industry events, such as user groups, trade shows, and conferences to build and manage relationships with prospective and existing customer base&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desired requirements:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Accounting, Finance, Sales, or adjacent field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-10 years of experience in a value-based sales model, preferably in IT Services &amp;amp; Consulting or SaaS industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate value to senior-level executives and proven experience in building and sustaining strong strategic relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written &amp;amp; verbal communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage strategic, consultative selling tactics and techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel to client sites &amp;amp; industry events up to 40% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks &amp;amp; Benefits:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Performance-based commission (for eligible roles)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive benefits, 401k matching plan, and wellness resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to earn stock options for top-performers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid company &amp;amp; flex holidays&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;ZINGy environment: quarterly events, team outings, and MORE!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;HighRadius provides a single Agentic AI platform for the Office of the CFO. It integrates 180+ agents that orchestrate end-to-end processes across Order-to-Cash, Close &amp;amp; Reconciliation, Consolidation &amp;amp; Reporting, Accounts Payable, B2B Payments, and Treasury. HighRadius guarantees operational KPI improvements by mapping them to specific agents on the platform. With a 3-6 month go-live period, HighRadius drives value creation at 1300+ enterprises such as 3M, Unilever, Bristol-Myers Squibb Company, Red Bull, Lufthansa, and more. HighRadius has been consistently recognized as a market leader by Gartner, IDC, and Forrester.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a highly skilled Agent Developer Test-III to design and implement robust test automation frameworks, ensure product scalability and quality, and drive quality engineering best practices across the organization. You will work closely with engineering, product, and DevOps teams to ensure delivery of high-quality software in a fast-paced Agile environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Automation &amp;amp; Test Strategy&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Design, develop, and maintain scalable test automation frameworks (UI, API, and backend).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive test strategy and architecture decisions for complex systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build reusable testing utilities and tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure high automation coverage across releases.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Test Development &amp;amp; Execution&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Develop automated test scripts using tools like Selenium, Cypress, Playwright, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Perform API testing using tools such as RestAssured, Postman, or similar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Implement performance and load testing (e.g., JMeter, Gatling).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CI/CD &amp;amp; DevOps Integration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Integrate automated tests into CI/CD pipelines (Jenkins, GitHub Actions, Azure DevOps).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ensure continuous testing and quality validation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborate with DevOps to improve build and deployment pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Quality Engineering Practices&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Define and enforce quality standards, test processes, and best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct code reviews for test automation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor junior SDETs and QA engineers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cross-functional Collaboration&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work closely with developers and product teams to understand requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Participate in sprint planning, design discussions, and retrospective meetings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Champion shift-left testing approach.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience Needed&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Technical Skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong programming skills in Java / Python / JavaScript&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Expertise in test automation frameworks (Selenium, TestNG, Cypress, Playwright)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in API automation testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of databases (SQL/NoSQL)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hands-on experience with CI/CD pipelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with microservices architecture testing&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Advanced Skills&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience with performance testing tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of containerization (Docker, Kubernetes)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS/Azure/GCP)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of security testing basics&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong problem-solving mindset&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Excellent communication and collaboration skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to lead initiatives and mentor team members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proactive and ownership-driven attitude&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice-to-Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in FinTech or SaaS domain&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to AI/ML-based applications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Knowledge of BDD frameworks (Cucumber, SpecFlow)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Act as a quality champion within the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Influence architecture-level testing decisions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Drive automation-first approach&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentor and guide junior engineers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Deliver high-quality products at scale&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Typical Tech Stack (HighRadius-like)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Languages: Java, Python, JavaScript&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automation: Selenium, Cypress, Playwright&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;API: RestAssured, Postman&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CI/CD: Jenkins, GitHub Actions&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Performance: JMeter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HighRadius is a pioneering, India-based autonomous finance platform that transforms the Office of the CFO for global enterprises. It automates core financial processes like Order-to-Cash, Record to Report, Accounts Payable, and Treasury. Operating at massive scale, HighRadius serves 1,300+ customers in 90+ countries, including giants like Redbull, Nike, Adobe, Unilever, Service Now, Warner Bro, L’Oreal, P&amp;amp;G, Nestle, and many more. In 2025 alone, the platform automated &lt;strong&gt;$25 trillion&lt;/strong&gt; in invoices—a volume equivalent to 70% of the US GDP.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Recognized as an undisputed market leader by Gartner, IDC, and the Hackett Group, HighRadius pairs global reach with deep R&amp;amp;D. Its 20+ product suite leverages proprietary AI like FreedaGPT, LiveCube, and 180+ orchestrated autonomous agents. Backed by 37 patents, the 2024 SaaSBoomi &quot;SaaS Startup of the Year&quot; sets the global standard for financial AI while uniquely committing to contractual business outcomes for its clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Title: Agent Product Builder&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will be working on the following key problems:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-End Agent Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Build, orchestrate, and deploy autonomous AI agents to drive 90%+ automation across Office of the CFO functions for Fortune 500 clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Big Finance data transformation: &lt;/strong&gt;HighRadius sits atop the world&#39;s most complex financial data; through world’s leading financial data transformation platform: &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/livecube/&quot;&gt;LiveCube&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver measurable value to Fortune 500 clients &lt;/strong&gt;through Predictive forecasting, work optimization &amp;amp; prioritization, Anomaly identification, etc., leveraging Patent backed AI/ML algorithms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unstructured Data processing: &lt;/strong&gt;Custom Algos for Matching, Reconciliations, Parsing etc. core financial process which beat industry’s models by 50%+.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role is based out of the Hyderabad location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent Development:&lt;/strong&gt; Independently design, code, and deploy autonomous agents from scratch to automate critical Office of the CFO workflows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Applied Data Science:&lt;/strong&gt; Leverage Data Analytics for predictive forecasting, anomaly detection, and data reconciliation, directly impacting Fortune 500 clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Visualization:&lt;/strong&gt; Design clear, intuitive data visualizations and tracking dashboards to continuously monitor agent health, prove out the 90%+ automation metrics, and communicate your product&#39;s impact to senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Full-Lifecycle Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Operate as a self-contained builder. You will be writing product requirements; you will develop from the first line of code and model training to final deployment and iteration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Algo first thinking:&lt;/strong&gt; Dive deep into massive, complex financial datasets. Write algos to solve NP Hard problems (Think Knapsack, or Mixed Integer Linear Programming but on Petabytes of Data).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;High-Intensity Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Thrive in a demanding, results-driven culture that values a &quot;no excuses&quot; mentality, speed of execution, and extreme dedication to hitting ambitious milestones and KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply first principles thinking to break down and solve ambiguous problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must possess Technical acumen and system design knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent Academic record from a top tier IIT&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical skills required - Functional Programming language (Pref. Rust), OOP (Python or Java), Distributed syst&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

