&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deal Desk Analyst&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A Deal Desk Analyst is responsible for providing analysis and support to the sales team in the form of pricing, discounts, contract terms, and product availability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the sales process and develop deal structures to address HRC customers’ objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and manage escalations and internal objections related to pricing and other commercial terms&lt;/li&gt;
