&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Penetrate untapped markets, build executive trust from the ground up, and position HighRadius as the undisputed premier solution for the Office of the CFO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; High-velocity prospecting, aggressive competitive positioning, and the tactical precision to close complex enterprise deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core Responsibilities (Both Roles)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Influence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Extracting critical intelligence from champions to shift stakeholders from &quot;education&quot; to &quot;active buy mode.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
