&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a Payments industry expert who loves working with complex financial workflows and advising companies on payment gateway connections with processors and banks? HighRadius is looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Digital Transformation Principal&lt;/strong&gt; to champion our Payments Automation solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this highly strategic, pre-sales role, you will bridge the gap between complex B2B payments technology and executive-level business value. You will partner with Fortune 1000 CFOs to diagnose their current payment friction points and design modern, automated digital transformation strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day-to-Day:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Discovery:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct deep-dive operational assessments to uncover friction in a prospect’s current B2B payment ecosystem (e.g., high interchange fees, manual cash application, cross-border and multi-currency complexities) and map them to HighRadius solutions with their corresponding value propositions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Value Engineering:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and present compelling business cases, ROI models, and Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) analyses to justify technology investments to finance executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Demonstrations:&lt;/strong&gt; Deliver powerful, tailored product demonstrations to the Finance departments of enterprise-level clients, up to the CFO.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborative Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with cross-functional stakeholders to architect scalable digital payment transformation roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Management Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with Product Management and Strategy teams to influence the product roadmap based on real-world prospect feedback and emerging trends in the Payments industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to be Successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Payments Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep knowledge of the B2B payments landscape, including merchant acquiring, credit card processing (interchange optimization, Level 2/3/CEDP data), direct debit (ACH, SEPA, Bacs, BECS, etc.), alternative payment methods, digital wallets, real-time payments (RTP), and global payment gateways.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pre-Sales / Consulting Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record in a Sales Engineering, Solutions Consulting, or tech-focused Management Consulting role, ideally selling into the Office of the CFO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Presence:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional communication, storytelling, and presentation skills, with a proven ability to build trust and sustain strategic relationships with C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analytical Mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to translate complex technical workflows and solutions into quantifiable business value (ROI) and easily understandable customer-facing presentations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s Degree in Accounting, Finance, Computer Science, Engineering, or a related technical/financial field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel:&lt;/strong&gt; Willingness to travel domestically up to 40% to meet with enterprise prospects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
