&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Your Day-to-Day: The &quot;Build &amp;amp; Deploy&quot; Cycle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Intelligence: &lt;/strong&gt;Use HighRadius’s AI agents to process large data sets to uncover hidden patterns in the client’s Order-to-Cash (O2C) process and design the future-state architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
