&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a senior &lt;strong&gt;Oracle Financials Techno-Functional Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; for a hands-on, function-forward Individual Contributor (IC) role. In this position, you will lead functional solution design and business process optimization across Order-to-Cash (O2C), Procure-to-Pay (P2P), and Record-to-Report (R2R) solutions, while leveraging your deep technical background to architect, configure, and validate seamless integrations between Oracle Cloud Fusion Financials (GL, AP, AR, FA, Cash Management, Subledger Accounting) and HighRadius Autonomous Finance products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Solution &amp;amp; Process Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead workshops to map client business requirements to Oracle Financials Cloud modules, specializing in General Ledger (GL), Accounts Payable (AP), Accounts Receivable (AR), Fixed Assets (FA), Cash Management, Subledger Accounting (SLA), Credit, Collections, and Deductions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debug Oracle/ERP Errors:&lt;/strong&gt; Conduct root-cause analysis for Oracle ERP functional and integration errors across O2C, P2P, R2R, and monthly closing cycles, delivering targeted configuration fixes and workaround options to minimize business downtime.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Architecture &amp;amp; Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide robust technical specifications and architectural guidance for Oracle Integration Cloud (OIC) integrations, REST/SOAP APIs, FBDI file templates, ESS jobs, and BI Publisher/OTBI analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Mapping &amp;amp; Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Design comprehensive data mapping frameworks to ensure financial master data (Supplier, Customer, CoA) and transactional data flow accurately between Oracle ledgers and the HighRadius cloud platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Testing &amp;amp; Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee integration testing, System Integration Testing (SIT), and User Acceptance Testing (UAT) to resolve complex subledger-to-ledger reconciliation and data synchronization discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advisory &amp;amp; Implementation Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the bridge between business stakeholders and technical teams throughout the deployment lifecycle, ensuring HighRadius products align with Oracle operational standards and accounting controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Oracle Functional Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of core functional expertise in Oracle Cloud Fusion Financials or Oracle EBS R12 across GL, AP, AR, FA, Cash Management, and Subledger Accounting (SLA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Technical Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on technical experience with SQL/PL-SQL, Oracle Integration Cloud (OIC), REST/SOAP Web Services, FBDI imports, and BI Publisher/OTBI reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record integrating third-party SaaS financial platforms (specifically HighRadius or similar fintech suites) with core Oracle ERP architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of financial workflows, order-to-cash cycles, subledger accounting rules, and month-end closing processes in large enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on functional configuration experience with HighRadius Autonomous Finance modules (Cash Application Cloud, Collections Cloud, Deductions Cloud, Credit Cloud, or Autonomous AP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience utilizing HighRadius Integration Accelerators (HEX) or Enterprise Data Warehouse (EDW) staging frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oracle Financials Cloud Certification (Payables, General Ledger, or Receivables) or background in enterprise ERP transformations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h4&gt;About Us&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HighRadius provides a single Agentic AI platform for the Office of the CFO. It integrates 180+ agents that orchestrate end-to-end processes across &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/order-to-cash/?ref=home&quot;&gt;Order-to-Cash&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/financial-close-and-reconciliation-software/&quot;&gt;Close &amp;amp; Reconciliation,&amp;nbsp; &lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/financial-consolidation-and-reporting/&quot;&gt;Consolidation &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/accounts-payable/&quot;&gt;Accounts Payable&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/b2b-payments/&quot;&gt;B2B Payments&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/software/treasury-risk/&quot;&gt;Treasury&lt;/a&gt;. HighRadius guarantees operational KPI improvements by mapping them to specific agents on the platform. With a 3-6 month go-live period, HighRadius drives value creation at 1300+ enterprises such as 3M, Unilever, Bristol-Myers Squibb Company, Red Bull, Lufthansa, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/resources/customers/&quot;&gt;more&lt;/a&gt;. HighRadius has been consistently recognized as a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.highradius.com/resources/analyst-reports/&quot;&gt;market leader&lt;/a&gt; by Gartner, IDC, and Forrester.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan, execute, and optimize paid search campaigns across platforms such as Google Ads and Microsoft Advertising (Bing Ads).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct keyword research, competitor analysis, and audience targeting to improve campaign performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage campaign structures, bidding strategies, ad copy testing, and budget allocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key performance metrics, including CTR, CPC, Conversion Rate, CPA, ROAS, and Impression Share.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze search term reports and implement positive and negative keyword strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute A/B tests for ads, landing pages, and bidding approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with content, design, SEO, and marketing teams to improve campaign effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate weekly and monthly performance reports with actionable insights and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn, track, and troubleshoot conversion tracking using tools such as Google Analytics 4 and platform conversion tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on industry trends, platform updates, and best practices in paid search.&lt;/li&gt;
