&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Marketing, Analytics, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of hands-on experience managing paid search campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in Google Ads, Microsoft Ads, keyword research, and bid management(Applicable only if the person is from Digital Marketing)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Google Analytics and reporting tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with proficiency in Excel/Google Sheets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to interpret performance data and translate findings into optimization actions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Marketing Communications, Ad Copy, Content, and Landing Page design&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with attribution models and conversion tracking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with CRM integrations and lead management platforms like HubSpot, Salesforce, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Google Ads and Google Analytics certifications(Applicable only if the person is from Digital Marketing)&lt;/li&gt;
