&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring for Program Director and Associate Program Director roles as they are an integral part of the Consulting team by playing a key role by building effective client relationships and managing multiple complex Enterprise projects to completion. The roles both require up to 50% travel to client sites.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Day-to-Day:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with external stakeholders (Executive, Business and IT teams of clients) and internal stakeholders (Product, Sales, Operations,&amp;nbsp; Consulting, Management) to be in control of desired business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve strategic trusted-adviser level relationships with clients to create a win-win solution for clients and HighRadius, balancing interests to drive value and ROI for all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand the details of business processes and solutions related to order to cash to have effective conversation with external clients and provide guidance to internal teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage internal project delivery team for timely completion of project, including activities such as developing project plans, estimations, defining scope, change management, negotiations, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build rapport as a true business partner by leveraging assertiveness and emotional intelligence to work positively with peers and executives to complete client needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage client expectations, risks and project issues.&amp;nbsp; Triage client escalation while working with internal teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate and mitigate changes in scope, ensuring that project is delivered on-time and on-budget&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct and implement a balanced scope and change request process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with a global client-services team consisting of Consultants, Solution Delivery Managers, and Project Managers on a daily basis to meet the client’s needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with our global product management team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help to build and improve the implementation, training methodologies and the tools needed future implementations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage deliverables to achieve project and client goals; will be assigned 5-10 projects at any time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be eager to learn and keep up to date on HighRadius products, capabilities, and new features&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel on-site to teach the client how to use our SaaS system and facilitate testing (up to 20% travel)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to be Successful:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Education: Bachelor’s degree in Engineering, Computer Science, Mathematics, or similar quantitative fields.&lt;/li&gt;
