&lt;li&gt;Domain Knowledge: Strong understanding of Order-to-Cash (OTC) processes (Cash Apps, Collections, Deductions) and general financial concepts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tech Stack: Hands-on experience with major ERPs (SAP, Oracle Cloud, NetSuite, Workday) or SaaS/PaaS financial modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Core Skills: Proven ability in requirements gathering, business analysis, and presentation/facilitation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soft Skills: Excellent verbal/written communication, ability to negotiate and influence, and experience managing complex stakeholder matrices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execution: Ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously, anticipate risks, and adapt to changing schedules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
