&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a senior &lt;strong&gt;SAP FICO Techno-Functional Consultant&lt;/strong&gt; for a hands-on, function-forward Individual Contributor (IC) role. In this position, you will lead functional solution design and business process optimization across the Order-to-Cash (O2C) Procure-To-Pay (P2P), Record-To-Report (R2R) solutions while leveraging your deep technical background to architect, configure, and validate seamless integrations between SAP ECC / S/4HANA and HighRadius Autonomous Finance products.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Functional Solution &amp;amp; Process Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead workshops to map client business requirements to SAP FI/CO and HighRadius modules, specializing in Accounts Receivable, Accounts Payable, General Ledger, Treasury, Credit, Collections, Cash Application, and Deductions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Debug SAP errors&lt;/strong&gt; -Conduct root-cause analysis for SAP functional errors across order-to-cash/procure-to-pay/record to report/monthly closing cycles, delivering targeted configuration fixes and workaround options to minimize business downtime.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Architecture &amp;amp; Guidance:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with development teams by providing robust technical specifications for custom ABAP developments, BAPIs, BADIs, IDOCs, ALE, and API-based integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Mapping &amp;amp; Gap Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Design comprehensive data mapping frameworks to ensure financial master and transactional data flows accurately between SAP ledgers and the HighRadius cloud platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Testing &amp;amp; Validation:&lt;/strong&gt; Oversee integration testing, functional verification, and User Acceptance Testing (UAT) to resolve complex reconciliation and data synchronization discrepancies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Advisory &amp;amp; Implementation Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the bridge between business stakeholders and technical teams throughout the deployment lifecycle, ensuring HighRadius products align with SAP operational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SAP Functional Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of core functional expertise in SAP FI/CO (GL, AP, AR) and SAP Financial Supply Chain Management (FSCM) modules.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solid Technical Literacy:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on technical background in SAP ABAP, including reviewing or building BAPIs, BADIs, User Exits, IDOCs, and connecting external cloud APIs to SAP systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Integration Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven experience integrating third-party SaaS financial tools (specifically HighRadius or similar fintech suites) with core SAP ECC or S/4HANA architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Business Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong understanding of financial workflows, order-to-cash cycles, and reconciliation processes in large enterprise environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree in Accounting, Finance, Information Technology, Computer Science, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on functional configuration experience with HighRadius products (Cash Application Cloud, Collections Cloud, Deductions Cloud, or Credit Cloud).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience utilizing HighRadius Integration Accelerators (HEX) or SAP Business Technology Platform (BTP).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in client-facing consulting, process re-engineering, and global enterprise rollouts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a DevOps Engineer who is passionate about treating infrastructure as software. Your primary focus will be designing, building, and maintaining automated infrastructure using Terraform. You will be responsible for the &quot;Automation First&quot; strategy, ensuring our cloud environments are scalable, reproducible, and secure through code. This role focuses strictly on provisioning, configuration management, and CI/CD pipelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience Level: 5-8 Years&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Location: Hyderabad&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Work Mode: **5 days working from office**&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Infrastructure as Code (IaC): Architect and maintain complex infrastructure modules using Terraform to ensure consistent environment setups across Dev, Staging, and Production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloud Architecture: Design and deploy scalable, highly available, and fault-tolerant systems on [AWS/Azure/GCP].&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CI/CD Pipeline Engineering: Build and optimize automated deployment pipelines (Jenkins, GitLab CI, or GitHub Actions) to streamline the delivery of containerized applications.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Containerization: Manage and orchestrate containerized workloads using Docker and Kubernetes (EKS/AKS/GKE).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configuration Management: Utilize tools like Ansible or Packer to automate server configurations and image creation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Security Integration: Implement &quot;Security as Code&quot; by integrating automated vulnerability scanning and IAM policy enforcement within the IaC workflow.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaboration: Work closely with development teams to &quot;containerize&quot; applications and provide them with self-service infrastructure capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Technical Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;IaC Mastery: Expert-level experience with Terraform (HCL), including state management, workspaces, and reusable module development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cloud Platforms: Strong hands-on experience with [AWS/Azure/GCP] services (VPC, IAM, Compute, RDS, S3).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Container Orchestration: Proficiency in Kubernetes and Docker (writing Dockerfiles, managing K8s manifests/Helm charts).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Scripting: Advanced proficiency in Python, Bash, or Go for automation tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Version Control: Expert knowledge of Git (branching strategies, GitOps workflows).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build Tools: Experience with Maven, Gradle, or similar tools for Java/Node/Python environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills &amp;amp; Mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Automation-First: A mindset that refuses to perform the same task manually twice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analytical Thinking: Ability to debug complex networking or deployment issues within a distributed system.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Communication: Ability to explain architectural decisions to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What is NOT required in this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This position does not involve managing or configuring Monitoring/Logging stacks (e.g., Prometheus, Grafana, ELK, Datadog).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a pure Provisioning and deployment-focused role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

